{"name": "Fleck & Grus", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842490/extras/ed24d54b1e7e6590f45bea7f6fd5b615.avif?t=1783068506\" width=\"600\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help Grus escort his friend Fleck safely back to his hometown in this fast-paced precision platformer. Navigate tight levels packed with tricky jumps, bouncing mechanics, and deadly hazards. Stay sharp, react quickly, and master each challenge to survive the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grus is fishing peacefully on his natal town when he encounters a strange octopus. After taking it home the cephalopod begs for Grus\u2019 help after revealing he is the son of Atlantis and before he can even deny, a dark cloud whit the shape of a giant kraken appears threatening to flood the world if the heir to Atlantis hasn\u2019t returned home before sunset. With no other option Grus will have to dive into the depths of the ocean to defeat the evil creature in order to save the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842490/extras/a40fc13b180859695c853dd6bb194d1f.avif?t=1783068506\" width=\"600\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump through tones of different levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842490/extras/44ba535f21333f0a9c1118cfc23ae24e.poster.avif?t=1783068506\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842490/extras/44ba535f21333f0a9c1118cfc23ae24e.webm?t=1783068506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842490/extras/44ba535f21333f0a9c1118cfc23ae24e.mp4?t=1783068506\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover every evironment from the swamps to the mighty city of Atlantis.<br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842490/extras/23f9095dc9e3bef2b84bd6fd2431be8f.poster.avif?t=1783068506\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842490/extras/23f9095dc9e3bef2b84bd6fd2431be8f.webm?t=1783068506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842490/extras/23f9095dc9e3bef2b84bd6fd2431be8f.mp4?t=1783068506\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span>And face the gigant kraken!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842490/extras/bc2e2786f979891887a44ef8455a5eba.poster.avif?t=1783068506\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842490/extras/bc2e2786f979891887a44ef8455a5eba.webm?t=1783068506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842490/extras/bc2e2786f979891887a44ef8455a5eba.mp4?t=1783068506\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842490/extras/a0314dc9cb71f37107ea1d9189626940.avif?t=1783068506\" wi